  "single-post": "<main class=\"page-content single-post-page padding-large\">\n      <div class=\"container post-container\">\n        <p>Riyadh / Interior / Delivered</p>\n        <h1>Executive Office Fit-out And Delivery</h1>\n        <img class=\"post-hero\" src=\"/images/banner-img.3.avif\" alt=\"FORMA project story\">\n        <p>This project page is prepared to show FORMA project stories with gallery images, area, duration, client type, materials, scope, challenges, delivery results, and an optional video.</p>\n        <p>The dashboard can update every published project so the public page reflects the latest design, finishing, furnishing, and management details without editing the template.</p>\n        <blockquote>Each project should communicate the problem, the design response, the execution scope, and the final result in a clear sequence.</blockquote>\n        <p>Are you amazed ?</p>\n        <ul><li>Blandit mauris libero condimentum commodo sociis convallis sit.</li><li>Magna diam amet justo sed vel dolor et volutpat integer.</li><li>Laculis sit sapien hac odio elementum egestas neque.</li></ul>\n        <div class=\"row g-4 align-items-start my-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><img src=\"/images/cart-img2.avif\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Project interior view\"></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><p><b>Scope and materials</b></p><p>The project record includes city, category, status, area, duration, images, scope, materials, challenges, and delivery results.</p><p>All details remain editable from the dashboard.</p></div></div>\n        <p>FORMA keeps project information structured so clients can browse delivered work while the team updates content without touching code.</p>\n        <div class=\"post-meta d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between py-4\"><div><a href=\"#\">Tech</a><a href=\"#\">Tips</a><a href=\"#\">Gadgets</a></div><div>Share: <span class=\"text-primary\">f ig tw in yt</span></div></div>\n        <nav class=\"post-nav d-flex justify-content-between border-top border-bottom border-dark py-4\"><a href=\"#\">← Retail Showroom Lighting And Display</a><a href=\"#\">Facade Study With Warm Exterior Materials →</a></nav>\n        <section class=\"comments padding-medium pb-0\">\n          <h2>3 Comments</h2>\n          <div class=\"comment-item\"><img src=\"/images/cart-img1.avif\" alt=\"\"><div><h5>FORMA Team</h5><p>Project comments and updates can be replaced with managed content blocks when connected to a database.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Review details</a></div></div>\n          <div class=\"comment-item ms-md-5\"><img src=\"/images/product-item3.avif\" alt=\"\"><div><h5>Design Review</h5><p>Material selections, lighting direction, and furnishing notes are tracked as part of the project record.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Review details</a></div></div>\n          <div class=\"comment-item\"><img src=\"/images/product-item2.avif\" alt=\"\"><div><h5>Delivery Review</h5><p>Final images, delivery outcomes, and client notes can be documented before publishing the project.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Review details</a></div></div>\n          <h2 class=\"mt-5\">Leave A Comment</h2><p>Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *</p>\n          <form class=\"line-form\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><label>Write Your Comment *</label><textarea class=\"form-control\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Write your comment here *\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label>Your Full Name *</label><input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Write your full name here *\"></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label>Your E-Mail Address *</label><input class=\"form-control\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Write your e-mail address *\"></div><button class=\"btn btn-dark w-100\" type=\"submit\">Post Comment</button></form>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"related-posts padding-large pb-0\"><div class=\"display-header d-flex justify-content-between\"><h2>Related Projects</h2><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/blog.html\">View Projects</a></div><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><article class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/banner-img.3.avif\" alt=\"\"><p>Riyadh / Interior / Delivered</p><h4>Villa Interior Direction And Material Planning</h4></article><article class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/cart-img2.avif\" alt=\"\"><p>Riyadh / Interior / Delivered</p><h4>Executive Office Fit-out And Delivery</h4></article><article class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/product-item3.avif\" alt=\"\"><p>Jeddah / Commercial / Delivered</p><h4>Retail Showroom Lighting And Display</h4></article><article class=\"col-md-3\"><img src=\"/images/video-image.avif\" alt=\"\"><p>Riyadh / Facade / Concept</p><h4>Facade Study With Warm Exterior Materials</h4></article></div></section>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n    <section id=\"newsletter\" class=\"newsletter-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row align-items-center\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><h2>Stay Updated With<br>FORMA</h2><p>Receive design updates, project notes, and material direction from our studio.</p></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><form class=\"newsletter-form d-flex\"><input class=\"form-control\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></div></section>",
